---
layout: default
title: Allison Ng — Portfolio
---

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="hero__text">
    <p class="hero__eyebrow">Software Engineer &amp; CS Grad Student</p>
    <h1 class="hero__name">
      Allison<span>Ng</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero__tagline">
      Building intelligent systems at the intersection of machine learning, full-stack development, and human-centered design.
    </p>
    <div class="hero__cta-group">
      <a href="#experience" class="btn btn--primary">View My Work</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn--outline">Get In Touch</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero__waveform-wrap">
    <div class="hero__waveform-label">
      <span class="hero__waveform-dot"></span>
      <span>LIVE SESSION — ALWAYS PRODUCING</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__waveform" aria-hidden="true">
      <!-- bars are generated by JS for variety -->
    </div>
    <div class="hero__waveform-meta">
      <span>AN_portfolio_2026.wav</span>
      <span>48kHz / 32-bit float</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="about">
  <div>
    <p class="section-label">A-Side — About</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">The Artist</h2>
    <p class="about__bio">
      MS Computer Science candidate at Emory University (GPA 3.925), graduating May 2026.
      I research medical imaging AI, teach data structures, and build full-stack applications—
      all while keeping a deep love for music, language, and making things that matter.
    </p>
    <div class="about__stats">
      <div class="about__stat">
        <div class="about__stat-num">3.93</div>
        <div class="about__stat-label">GPA</div>
      </div>
      <div class="about__stat">
        <div class="about__stat-num">3+</div>
        <div class="about__stat-label">Years Research</div>
      </div>
      <div class="about__stat">
        <div class="about__stat-num">4</div>
        <div class="about__stat-label">Languages</div>
      </div>
      <div class="about__stat">
        <div class="about__stat-num">2026</div>
        <div class="about__stat-label">Graduating</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about__edu">
      <div class="about__edu-label">Education — Emory University</div>
      <div class="about__edu-item">
        <div class="about__edu-degree">MS in Computer Science</div>
        <div class="about__edu-school">Aug 2025 — May 2026</div>
        <div class="about__edu-detail">GPA: 3.925 / 4.0</div>
      </div>
      <div class="about__edu-item" style="margin-bottom:0">
        <div class="about__edu-degree">BS in Computer Science, Business Minor</div>
        <div class="about__edu-school">Graduated May 2025</div>
        <div class="about__edu-detail">Dean's List, Spring 2022</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div>
    <!-- Decorative vinyl grooves -->
    <div class="about__grooves">
      <div class="about__grooves-inner">
        <!-- groove rings -->
        <div class="groove-ring" style="width:96%;height:96%;"></div>
        <div class="groove-ring" style="width:90%;height:90%;"></div>
        <div class="groove-ring" style="width:84%;height:84%;"></div>
        <div class="groove-ring" style="width:78%;height:78%;"></div>
        <div class="groove-ring" style="width:72%;height:72%;"></div>
        <div class="groove-ring" style="width:66%;height:66%;"></div>
        <div class="groove-ring" style="width:60%;height:60%;"></div>
        <div class="groove-ring" style="width:54%;height:54%;"></div>
        <div class="groove-ring" style="width:48%;height:48%;"></div>
        <div class="groove-ring" style="width:42%;height:42%;"></div>
        <div class="groove-ring" style="width:36%;height:36%;"></div>
        <!-- center label -->
        <div style="
          width:28%; aspect-ratio:1; border-radius:50%;
          background:#1a3a5c;
          display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;
          justify-content:center; position:absolute;
          text-align:center; padding:0.5rem;
        ">
          <div style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:0.85rem;color:#5ba8d4;letter-spacing:0.1em;">AN</div>
          <div style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:0.38rem;color:rgba(91,168,212,0.6);letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:0.2rem;">Emory Univ.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- EXPERIENCE -->
<section id="experience">
  <p class="section-label">Tracklist — Experience</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">Work History</h2>

  <div class="tracklist">

    <div class="track">
      <div class="track__num">01</div>
      <div class="track__body">
        <div class="track__title">Graduate Research Assistant</div>
        <div class="track__org">Emory University — Practical Data Mining &amp; Exploration Lab</div>
        <div class="track__desc">
          <ul>
            <li>Adapted and implemented a CNN-based binary image classification pipeline in PyTorch, evaluating how colormap selection affects diagnostic model performance across 3 architectures (InceptionNetV3, MobileNetV2, ResNet50) on two medical imaging datasets.</li>
            <li>Optimized model performance to achieve <strong>0.852 AUPROC</strong> and <strong>0.821 AUROC</strong> on erythema detection.</li>
            <li>Designed data cleansing and visualization pipeline using Grad-CAM heatmaps and binary segmentation masks for model interpretability.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="track__tags">
          <span class="track__tag">Python</span>
          <span class="track__tag">PyTorch</span>
          <span class="track__tag">CNNs</span>
          <span class="track__tag">Grad-CAM</span>
          <span class="track__tag">Scikit-learn</span>
          <span class="track__tag">Data Augmentation</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="track__date">Feb 2025 — Present</div>
    </div>

    <div class="track">
      <div class="track__num">02</div>
      <div class="track__body">
        <div class="track__title">Teaching Assistant — Computational Lab Rep</div>
        <div class="track__org">Emory University — Math &amp; CS Department</div>
        <div class="track__desc">
          <ul>
            <li>Mentored students in Python, Java, and data structures, reinforcing algorithmic problem-solving and debugging skills.</li>
            <li>Diagnosed and resolved equipment and software issues to ensure consistent system operation and student productivity.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="track__tags">
          <span class="track__tag">Java</span>
          <span class="track__tag">Python</span>
          <span class="track__tag">Data Structures</span>
          <span class="track__tag">Algorithms</span>
          <span class="track__tag">Teaching</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="track__date">Aug 2024 — May 2026</div>
    </div>

    <div class="track">
      <div class="track__num">03</div>
      <div class="track__body">
        <div class="track__title">Resource Description &amp; Processing Assistant</div>
        <div class="track__org">Emory University Libraries</div>
        <div class="track__desc">
          <ul>
            <li>Processed and catalogued incoming music assets using Ex Libris Alma and OCLC, ensuring accurate metadata entries.</li>
            <li>Contributed to metadata standardization and searchability improvements as part of a database enhancement project.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="track__tags">
          <span class="track__tag">Excel</span>
          <span class="track__tag">Data Entry</span>
          <span class="track__tag">Inventory Management</span>
          <span class="track__tag">Library Systems</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="track__date">Feb 2022 — May 2024</div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROJECTS -->
<section id="projects">
  <p class="section-label">Remixes — Projects</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">Featured Work</h2>

  <div class="projects-grid">

    <div class="project-card">
      <div class="project-card__side">B-Side No. 1</div>
      <h3 class="project-card__title">UpNext</h3>
      <p class="project-card__desc">
        Full-stack event discovery platform built with a team using React, Flask, and PostgreSQL. Features reusable component architecture, centralized styling, async frontend-backend communication, and robust error state handling.
      </p>
      <div class="project-card__tech">
        <span class="project-card__tech-tag">React</span>
        <span class="project-card__tech-tag">Flask</span>
        <span class="project-card__tech-tag">PostgreSQL</span>
        <span class="project-card__tech-tag">REST APIs</span>
        <span class="project-card__tech-tag">Python</span>
        <span class="project-card__tech-tag">JavaScript</span>
        <span class="project-card__tech-tag">CSS</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="project-card">
      <div class="project-card__side">B-Side No. 2</div>
      <h3 class="project-card__title">Bed, Bath &amp; Beyond Basic</h3>
      <p class="project-card__desc">
        ML project predicting Airbnb guest ratings from listing features. Built KNN, Decision Tree, Random Forest, and MLP models on a 74,000+ listing dataset with thorough feature engineering and cross-validation.
      </p>
      <div class="project-card__tech">
        <span class="project-card__tech-tag">Python</span>
        <span class="project-card__tech-tag">Pandas</span>
        <span class="project-card__tech-tag">Scikit-learn</span>
        <span class="project-card__tech-tag">Feature Engineering</span>
        <span class="project-card__tech-tag">Model Evaluation</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- SKILLS -->
<section id="skills">
  <p class="section-label">Studio — Skills</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">Toolkit</h2>

  <div class="skills-grid">

    <div class="skills-group">
      <div class="skills-group__title">Languages</div>
      <div class="skill-item">
        <span class="skill-item__name">Python</span>
